    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101124" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνυπο-δείκνῡμι</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνυπο-ύω</span></b>  (<i><span class="en">
